    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This Christian non-fiction visual novel is Quantum Soteriology and is for those 18+ only. And this is LGBT+ Affirming and Plural Affirming. (Quelques sections sont en fran</i>\u00e7a<i>is aussi) Wiki: <u></u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: Contains references to Anxiety and Asthma and Autism and Child Abuse and Corporeal Punishment and Depression and Hell and Mannerisms and Physical Abuse and Obsessive Compulsive Disorder and Self Harm and Scrupulosity and Social Anxiety and Suicide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349490/extras/real.png?t=1754947870\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>not</strong> fiction. <strong>And</strong> this is  real, the story of over a decade of abuse experienced by this autistic plural trans <strong>lesbian</strong> <i>Jaysa</i>. <strong>Zoom</strong> from <i>Sept 17 2014</i> to present day. Gain a deeper appreciation <strong>of</strong> <i>Christian theology</i> through the lens of <i>Christian</i>\u00a0<i>Infernalism</i>, <i>Christian</i>\u00a0<i>Annihilationism</i>,\u00a0<i>Christian</i>\u00a0<i>Infernannihilationism</i> and <i>Christian</i>\u00a0<i>Universalism</i>. Experience the accounts of the events as they unfold. <strong>Navigate</strong> and click through menus to unlock the <i>secret</i> behind the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349490/extras/and.png?t=1754947870\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And</i> this is a reason to <strong>live</strong>. Read through character dialogue on specific timestamped dates <strong>and</strong> view logs of past conversations to learn what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become immersed in over <i>400+ songs</i> ranging from lo-fi to symphonic metal. Experience heart felt interactions from your friends, delve into a deep web of complex lore. Collect items in your inventory. Play over <i>50+ minigames</i> to earn points! Unlock gallery images! Be careful as you <strong>navigate</strong> through randomized backgrounds and hidden <strong>zany</strong> messages. Contrast real world history with biblical scripture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find the name of your abuser. Remember your backstory. And embrace a world with color.</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Survive in this gray bloodstained hellscape.</i></p>",
